                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 34483,
                            "last_played": 1791773083
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The idea of Albion is great, the real problem is how the company behind it treats its players.\n\nRecently a content creator was banned for doing a crowdfund to help the family of a deceased guild member, he did it all while streaming the game, and he gave away one of his expensive items to viewers, with the gag that anyone could donate to have the giveaway rerolled. Guess what the company thought of that? They justified his ban saying that he was involved in RMT.\nThat is the opinion of the developers about their own players, if something has a microscopic chance of making their profit smaller they will not care if you helped a family with over 3 months worth of expenses or if you have been creating content and advertising their game for the past 5 years.\nShameful really, this was a good game at one point in time, not anymore.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1792159470,
